 "text": "Real Estate Look Up\nabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\n​​ STONE COUNTY ​​ ​ ​​\nCOLLECTOR OF REVENUE\n​Anna Burk\nHome\nSenior Tax Freeze\nReal Estate Look Up\nTax Certificate Sale\nOnline Forms\nMerchants License\nContact us\nMore\nClick here to search Stone County real estate property tax information. You will need to enter the complete property number exactly as it appears on your tax statement.\nREAL ESTATE LOOK UP\nAddress:\n​P.O. Box 256\n108 E. 4th Street\nGalena, MO 65656\n​\nTel: 417-357-6124 E mail: keely.cleland@stonecountymo.gov Fax: 417-357-1404\n\nDROP BOX for tax payments is available at the North Entrance of Historic Courthouse.\nDrop Box payments are checked daily.\nCourthouse Hours:\nMonday - Friday\n8:00 AM - 4:00 PM\n​\nClosed all State and Federal Holidays\n",
